 "strings": {
  "Let me explain. There are three processes involved\nin memory: encoding, storage, and retrieval.": "",
  "Alzheimer's impairs the first step, encoding.\nThis makes it near impossible to remember new things.": "",
  "Usually the disease impairs the first step, encoding.\nThis makes it near impossible to remember new things.": "",
  "I'll give you an example\nthat's stuck with me.": "",
  "I'll give you an example\nthat stuck with me.": "",
  "When doctors asked a dementia patient the date,\nthey had no problem producing the correct answer.": "",
  "But when asked the year, the patient said \"1952.\"\nTheir mind was stuck decades in the past.": "",
  "You see, dementia not only inhibits new memories,\nbut jumbles the ones you already have as well.": "",
  "You see, dementia inhibits new memories\nand <font_kind=yakuza_italic>may</font_kind> jumble the ones you have.": "",
  "Think you can repeat that?\nI'm not sure I caught it all.": "",
  "I think I understand.": "",
  "So, how exactly does AD-9\ncure Alzheimer's?": "",
  "According to their research,\nwhen they injected AD-9 into the test mice...": "",
  "Well... according to their research,\nwhen they injected AD-9 into the test mice...": "",
  "It brought about a process\nknown as autophagy.": "",
  "...It brought about a process\nknown as autophagy.": "",
  "It's a Greek word that means \"self-devouring.\"\nThat's what your body starts to do to its own proteins.": "",
  "It's a Greek word that means \"self-devouring.\"\nThat's when your body consumes its own proteins.": "",
  "In other words, all the amyloid beta built up\nin the mice's brains began to instantly break down.": "",
  "Instantly...": "",
  "Instantly...?": "",
  "Yes. And once it was all gone...": "",
  "Yes. And once the amyloid beta\nwas all gone...": "",
  "Their Alzheimer's stopped\nprogressing entirely.": "",
  "...the mice's Alzheimer's stopped\nprogressing entirely.": "",
  "The most shocking thing is that even brain cells\nwhich had lost function were able to recover.": "",
  "The most shocking thing is even the deadened\nbrain cells were able to recover.": "",
  "As one researcher put it, it's as though\nthe brain turns on a backup generator.": "",
  "As one scientist put it, \"It's like the brain's\nemergency power got turned on.\"": "",
  "If they can bring about similar effects in humans...": "",
  "If they can bring about\nsimilar effects in humans...": "",
  "They'll have a cure for Alzheimer's.": "",
  "They'll have a cure for Alzheimer's?": "",
  "That's right. There are millions of patients worldwide,\nand that number is growing steadily every day.": "",
  "If they actually complete this drug,\nit could truly change the world as we know it.": "",
  "If they can actually perfect AD-9,\nit could truly change the world as we know it.": "",
  "It's nothing short of a dream drug\nfor both buyers and sellers.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I see. If that's true, it really would be\na dream drug. But...)</color>": "",
  "If you ask me...\nIt sounds too good to be true.": "",
  "Can it really do everything they say?\nIt sounds too good to be true.": "",
  "I mean...": "",
  "The vice director of the ADDC suspected\nsomething fishy was going on with it.": "",
  "The vice director of the ADDC suspected\nsomething fishy was going on with AD-9.": "",
  "But when he started digging around...": "",
  "Someone offed him to keep their secret safe.\nMade it look like a brawl so nobody'd get suspicious.": "",
  "...Someone offed him to keep their secret safe.\nMade it look like a brawl so nobody'd get suspicious.": "",
  "What kind of secret are we talking?": "",
  "Like the drug's effects being falsified.": "",
  "Oh, there's no chance of that.": "",
  "Huh? How do you know?": "",
  "Since the announcement of AD-9,\ncountless animal tests have proven successful.": "",
  "They've been doing successful tests of AD-9\non mice ever since it was first announced.": "",
  "It's no fabrication.": "",
  "Those results are no fabrication.": "",
  "One test after another,\nthey've proven its viability.": "",
  "They've already scientifically proven\nit's a viable medicine.": "",
  "And you're sure?": "",
  "Very sure.": "",
  "I'm of the mind they should push forward faster.\nEven if the paper was a little rough around the edges.": "",
  "Honestly, I think they should push forward faster,\neven if the paper was a little rough around the edges.": "",
  "After all, dementia drugs are being\ndeveloped all around the world.": "",
  "Dementia drugs are being\ndeveloped all around the world.": "",
  "It would be a shame if someone beat them\nto the punch. Both for the ADDC and for Japan.": "",
  "If someone beat them to the punch,\nit'd be a national shame.": "",
  "Kido-san is far too cautious.\nThis is no time to be testing on animals.": "",
  "They need to move to clinical trials\nand get this thing out.": "",
  "They need to get this into clinical trials.": "",
  "By which you mean...": "",
  "Experimenting on humans.": "",
  "Bring in human subjects.": "",
  "Human experimentation.": "",
  "Human testing, huh...?": "",
  "What's wrong?": "",
  "Oh, nothing. Just... are you absolutely\nsure there's nothing off about AD-9?": "",
  "Nothing. Just... are you absolutely sure\nthere's nothing off about AD-9?": "",
  "I guess there is an\ninteresting detail I noticed.": "",
  "Well, let's see... I guess there <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> an\ninteresting detail.": "",
  "Kido-san is listed as the sole author\nof the AD-9 research.": "",
  "On the paperwork for AD-9's research,\nKido-san is listed as the lead author.": "",
  "But in truth, he only put his name\non the paper to lend it credibility.": "",
  "But... his name was only on that paper\nto give it some industry credibility.": "",
  "The key researcher was someone else entirely.\nA guy you know, too. Man by the name of Shono.": "",
  "The key researcher was someone else entirely.\nWell, maybe you know the guy. A researcher named Shono.": "",
  "So you're saying...\nShono's the creator of AD-9?": "",
  "So AD-9's actual architect... is Shono?": "",
  "Seems so. The paper would never have gained such\nworldwide traction without Kido-san, though.": "",
  "Seems so. But the paper would never have gained\nsuch worldwide traction without Kido-san.": "",
  "They needed a leading expert to rubberstamp\nthe research and make it seem more official.": "",
  "Naturally, they needed a leading expert to rubberstamp\nthe research, make it seem more official.": "",
  "That kinda thing is pretty common,\nthough. Not really a cause for concern.": "",
  "That kinda thing is pretty common.\nNot really a cause for concern.": "",
  "Shono...\nWhat's your role in all of this?": "",
  "Yoji Shono... What's your role\nin all of this?": "",
  "So the one I want... It's Shono, huh?": "",
  "Is it... really Shono?": "",
  "Yo, welcome back.": "",
  "Yo. You miss us?": "",
  "Hey there, Yagami-san.": "",
  "The gang's all here, huh?": "",
  "Whoa, the gang's all here.": "",
  "How did things go with Hattori-san?\nDid you learn anything useful?": "",
  "Yeah, I guess.": "",
  "...Yeah, I guess.": "",
  "You should go over what Hattori-san told you\nwhile everyone's here, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san, as long as you've got everyone here,\nyou should go over your findings.": "",
  "Wait, are you saying there isn't\nactually anything up with AD-9?": "",
  "What? So you think AD-9 might be legit\nafter all?": "",
  "That's what Hattori said, yeah.": "",
  "That's what Hattori said.": "",
  "This is the first time I'm hearing about\nKido not really being involved, though.": "",
  "But... this is the first I've heard that\nKido might not be involved.": "",
  "It's possible Shono's hiding\nthe truth from even him.": "",
  "It's possible Shono's hiding the truth\nfrom even him.": "",
  "But first... one term in particular stuck\nwith me from my chat with Hattori-san.": "",
  "But first... one term in particular stuck with me\nfrom my chat with Hattori-san.": "",
  "Which is?": "",
  "Apparently AD-9 is just about ready\nto be tested on real human subjects.": "",
  "Well that's gross. Side effects include bloating,\nblindness, and <font_kind=yakuza_italic>death</font_kind>, right?": "",
  "Well, that's kinda gross. Makes me think of\nthe corpses with their eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Knock it off.": "",
  "Damn, kid.": "",
  "Sorry, sorry. What's bothering you\nabout that, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Anyhow, what's bothering you\nabout that?": "",
  "Well, it's just...": "",
  "Well, uh...": "",
  "I've just been thinking, what if all these murders\nwere secretly experimental trials for AD-9?": "",
  "With all the Mole's murders... If they were all just\nexperimental trials for AD-9, what would that mean?": "",
  "You're... You're serious?": "",
  "Hold up a sec...\nYou're serious here?": "",
  "If Shono's the one behind all this...": "",
  "Just, if Shono's the one behind the Mole...": "",
  "What, you think this guy Shono went out,\nhired an assassin, and started killing people?": "",
  "Then what? You think this guy Shono hired an assassin\nand started <font_kind=yakuza_italic>killing people</font_kind>?": "",
  "Guess it's a bit of a stretch, huh?": "",
  "Even if these people were test cases,\nwhy would Shono have to murder them?": "",
  "Even if these people <font_kind=yakuza_italic>were</font_kind> test cases,\nwhat reason would Shono have to murder them?": "",
  "This is a dementia drug,\nnot some kind of chemical weapon.": "",
  "He's making a cure, not a virus.": "",
  "No but, what if it really did have some\nkinda crazy side effects, though?": "",
  "I know, but... what if it had\nsome kinda crazy side effects?": "",
  "Like, they didn't wanna kill the people,\nbut they ended up dying anyways.": "",
  "Maybe they didn't actually\nmean to kill anyone.": "",
  "It was perfectly fine when they\ntested it on mice, though.": "",
  "It was perfectly fine\nwhen they tested it on mice, though.": "",
  "If it ended up killing someone, then...\nWait a sec...": "",
  "If it ended up killing a human,\nthen... Wait...": "",
  "Yeah, wait a sec is right.\nWe're on the same page here.": "",
  "What if AD-9 was completely harmless to mice...\nBut lethal when introduced into the human body?": "",
  "What if AD-9 was completely harmless to mice...\nbut lethal when introduced into the human body?": "",
  "If that was the case, they'd need to perform\na ton of experiments to make sure it was fixed.": "",
  "Right. They'd need to perform a ton of\nexperiments to make sure it was fixed.": "",
  "Which is why they killed all those Kyorei guys.": "",
  "Maybe... that's why they killed\nall those Kyorei guys.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If Shono needed to silence those yakuza,\nhe might have resorted to using the Mole...)</color>": "",
  "Back it up. If they're testing a drug,\nwouldn't they wanna use it on an actual patient?": "",
  "Hold on. If they're testing a drug,\nwouldn't they wanna use it on an actual patient?": "",
  "I mean, it's not like those Kyorei guys\nall had Alzheimer's or anything.": "",
  "I mean, it's not like all the Mole's victims\nhad Alzheimer's or anything.": "",
  "Actually, it says here that they test\nnew drugs on healthy humans as well.": "",
  "Actually, it says here that they test new drugs\non healthy humans as well.": "",
  "They're the control group to make\nsure the drug is safe.": "",
  "They're the control group\nto make sure the drug is safe.": "",
  "Yeah, eventually. It wouldn't make any damn sense\nfor 'em to start on anyone but real patients, though.": "",
  "I could see that after a while, sure.\nBut they gotta <font_kind=yakuza_italic>start</font_kind> with patients, right?": "",
  "Just give it a rest.\nTry takin' this seriously for once.": "",
  "We are taking this seriously!": "",
  "We <font_kind=yakuza_italic>are</font_kind> being serious!": "",
  "Says the dumbass kid who keeps spouting tinfoil hat shit\nabout goddamn human experiments!": "",
  "Serious about this crazy human experiment BS?\nYou dumbasses buying this whack job shit!?": "",
  "The only dumbass here is the guy who can't\nconsider all the possible options!": "",
  "Dumbasses!? The only <font_kind=yakuza_italic>dumbass</font_kind> here is the guy\nwho can't consider all the possible options!": "",
  "Oh, is that right!?": "",
  "Next you're gonna tell me they experimented\non old man Waku, too! Fuckin' idiots.": "",
  "Well, hey, that Waku guy from the Center died too!\nHuman fuckin' experiments, right!?": "",
  "That incident three years ago at the ADDC.": "",
  "That was your case three years ago\nat the ADDC.": "",
  "The guy who died, Waku-san...\nDidn't he have Alzheimer's?": "",
  "Hey, I think you're onto something!": "",
  "Think about it, Kaito-san.": "",
  "The victim in that case...": "",
  "Waku-san was an Alzheimer's\npatient at the Center.": "",
  "Waku-san was an Alzheimer's patient\nat the Center.": "",
  "We know for a fact that Okubo didn't kill him,\nbut they never tracked the real murderer down.": "",
  "...This might be the answer.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What if the motivation for that murder\nwas a human experiment for AD-9?)</color>": "",
  "All right, cool your fuckin' jets.\nThat happened three years ago.": "",
  "All right, cool your fuckin' jets.\nThat happened three years ago, right?": "",
  "AD-9 didn't even exist back then!": "",
  "Back then, I'm pretty sure AD-9\ndidn't even exist.": "",
  "True, it was only announced last year.": "",
  "True, AD-9 was only formally\nannounced last year.": "",
  "But all the research that went into that paper\nwould have reached way further back.": "",
  "All the same, the research would have been\ngoing on much further back.": "",
  "Huh... Wait, are we really onto somethin'?": "",
  "Huh...? Wait...\nSeriously? We're onto something?": "",
  "It's hard to say for sure, but it's worth\nlooking into at the very least.": "",
  "It's hard to say for sure,\nbut it's worth looking into, at the very least.": "",
  "I have a few more thoughts about\nthis whole human experimentation theory.": "",
  "About that human experimentation theory...\nI have some more ideas.": "",
  "Mind if we continue?": "",
  "Actually, gimme a second.": "",
  "If AD-9's really what killed Waku-san\nthree years ago... the ADDC's finished.": "",
  "If that's really what killed Waku-san three years ago...\nAD-9 would be finished.": "",
  "Shit would be the scandal of the century.": "",
  "Shit would be the\nscandal of the century.": "",
  "Y'know, I'm starting to see things\na little clearer now...": "",
  "Y'know, I'm coming around\non team whack job...": "",
  "Okay, so...": "",
  "Let's say Shono did experiment on Waku-san.\nWhy would he do that?": "",
  "Let's say Shono <font_kind=yakuza_italic>did</font_kind> experiment on Waku-san.\nWhy would he go that far?": "",
  "They normally do a lot more to ensure a drug\nis safe before it enters clinical trials.": "",
  "They normally do a lot more to ensure a drug is safe\nbefore it enters clinical trials.": "",
  "What was his motive for testing it then?": "",
  "Why would Shono test it this way?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Let me think. Why would Shono have broken protocol\nand experimented on Waku?)</color>": "",
  "Maybe he wanted to try his groundbreaking new drug\non a real live human as soon as possible.": "",
  "Mm... Maybe... he wanted to try his groundbreaking new drug\non a real live human as soon as possible.": "",
  "If it worked, he'd have the cure.": "",
  "And he'd have it without dealing with all the red tape\nthese things go through. It would've saved him years.": "",
  "That's possible.": "",
  "I suppose...": "",
  "I guess Shono was surrounded\nby dementia patients.": "",
  "Shono <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> perpetually surrounded\nby dementia patients.": "",
  "One little test wouldn't be a big deal,\nand if it succeeded, his drug would save the world.  ": "",
  "One little test wouldn't raise any eyebrows,\nbut it could potentially save the world.": "",
  "If it meant curing Alzheimer's sooner,\nhe might've been okay accepting the risk.": "",
  "If it meant curing Alzheimer's sooner,\nhe might've been okay with the risk.": "",
  "But instead of doing what it was meant to do,\nAD-9 had a horrible side effect. Death.": "",
  "But Shono's plan backfired in the worst way.\nIts potential doesn't matter if the side effect is death.": "",
  "The more I think about it, the more it feels\nlike this is how it all went down.": "",
  "The more I think about the case three years ago,\nthe more it feels like this is how it all went down.": "",
  "It's startin' to make sense...": "",
  "Makes some sense.": "",
  "But now, even though he knows the risks...\nHe's still experimenting, and using the Mole to do it.": "",
  "But now, since he knows the risks of his\nexperiments... he's using the Mole.": "",
  "I know this is all just a theory...\nBut the pieces all seem to fit together.": "",
  "I know this is all just a theory...\nbut the pieces all seem to fit together.": "",
  "Going down that path, Yagami-san.\nThat means Okubo really was innocent, yeah?": "",
  "Going down that path, Yagami-san.\nThat'd mean Okubo really <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> innocent, yeah?": "",
  "But he murdered his girlfriend right after.\nI mean, that's why he's on death row.": "",
  "But if I recall, he murdered his girlfriend right after.\nThat's why he's on death row.": "",
  "Quit it, Sugiura.\nWe'll get to that later.": "",
  "Hrgh.": "",
  "So to summarize our theory so far...": "",
  "It all started three years ago, when Shono accidentally\nkilled a patient during an AD-9 test.": "",
  "It all started three years ago, when Shono performed\na test of AD-9... accidentally killing a patient.": "",
  "But those tests are still ongoing.\nThat's why Hamura had all those Kyorei guys killed.": "",
  "But similar tests are still ongoing even now.\nThat's why Hamura had all those Kyorei guys killed.": "",
  "But wait. How would a guy like Shono\nget wrapped up with yakuza and assassins?": "",
  "Your run-of-the-mill researcher wouldn't have\nthe cash or connections for that shit.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I mean...": "ก็คือ...",
  "What's wrong?": "เป็นอะไรไปเหรอ?",
  "Yeah, I guess.": "ครับ ก็จริง",
  "Which is?": "ทางไหนล่ะ?",
  "Well, it's just...": "ก็แค่ว่า...",
  "Well, uh...": "ก็ เอ่อ...",
  "Oh, is that right!?": "โอ้ อย่างนั้นเหรอ!?",
  "Okay, so...": "โอเค เอาล่ะ..."
 }
}
